00:38:05.000 --> 00:38:05.300
Yeah.
对。

1149
00:38:05.360 --> 00:38:06.420
He just had the sling on.
他只是戴着悬带。

1150
00:38:06.760 --> 00:38:09.160
And he walked up and he got to board early.
然后走过去，就获得了优先登机的资格。

1151
00:38:09.300 --> 00:38:09.740
Did he tell people?
他告诉别人了吗？

1152
00:38:09.740 --> 00:38:10.560
He doesn't do it anymore.
他现在不这么做了。

1153
00:38:10.760 --> 00:38:14.200
When people would ask how he broke the arm, would he say something cooler than boogie boarding?
当别人问他胳膊是怎么骨折的时，他会不会编个比冲浪板更酷的理由？

1154
00:38:14.340 --> 00:38:14.560
What do you?
你呢？

1155
00:38:14.600 --> 00:38:15.020
I don't know.
我不知道。

1156
00:38:15.740 --> 00:38:16.500
I'm not sure.
我不确定。

1157
00:38:16.720 --> 00:38:17.220
I haven't asked.
我没问过。

1158
00:38:17.220 --> 00:38:17.820
I'll ask him.
我会去问他的。

1159
00:38:17.860 --> 00:38:19.340
Would he be like, you should see the other guy?
他会不会说，你该看看另一个人？

1160
00:38:19.560 --> 00:38:19.700
Yeah.
对。

1161
00:38:20.020 --> 00:38:21.440
Like nobody wanted to say boogie boarding.
就好像没人好意思说是冲浪板弄的。

1162
00:38:22.040 --> 00:38:23.420
You should see the water.
你应该看看那片水域。

1163
00:38:23.680 --> 00:38:24.380
Body surfing.
人体冲浪。

1164
00:38:24.380 --> 00:38:25.220
They hit me hard.
他们狠狠地撞了我。

1165
00:38:25.720 --> 00:38:26.120
Exactly.
确实。

1166
00:38:27.320 --> 00:38:28.740
I don't think I would.
我觉得我不会。

1167
00:38:28.740 --> 00:38:32.480
I don't think I would pretend to be a couple for the discount.
我觉得我不会为了打折而假装是一对情侣。

1168
00:38:33.040 --> 00:38:35.660
Would you pretend to wear a sling to board a plane early?
你会为了提前登机而假装打着悬臂绷带吗？

1169
00:38:36.720 --> 00:38:37.360
I might.
我可能会。

1170
00:38:37.500 --> 00:38:38.060
Flying's rough.
坐飞机太难受了。

1171
00:38:38.140 --> 00:38:39.900
All bets are off at the airport.
在机场什么规矩都不管用了。

1172
00:38:40.100 --> 00:38:40.240
Yeah.
是啊。

1173
00:38:40.500 --> 00:38:42.860
Honestly, the airport is such a no man's land.
说实话，机场真是一个无法无天的地方。

1174
00:38:43.040 --> 00:38:44.380
I might do anything at the airport.
我在机场什么都干得出来。

1175
00:38:44.980 --> 00:38:45.560
All right.
好吧。

1176
00:38:45.560 --> 00:38:46.720
Last office question.
最后一个办公室的问题。

1177
00:38:47.020 --> 00:38:51.400
Is there any part of you that wishes that you were on the work bus with us?
你内心深处有没有哪怕一点点希望自己当时能和我们一起坐那辆工作大巴？

1178
00:38:51.780 --> 00:38:54.200
Like, did you and Jake discuss that day?
比如，你和杰克讨论过那天的事吗？

1179
00:38:54.400 --> 00:38:55.160
Like the next week?
就像第二周的时候？

1180
00:38:55.280 --> 00:38:57.940
Did he download you on everything that happened on that bus?
他把那辆大巴上发生的一切都向你汇报了吗？

1181
00:38:58.100 --> 00:39:00.340
You know the lore that we call it death bus?
你知道我们把它叫作死亡大巴的传说吗？

1182
00:39:00.680 --> 00:39:01.700
I don't think I do.
我觉得我不知道。

1183
00:39:02.220 --> 00:39:04.000
You don't know about death bus?
你不知道死亡大巴？

1184
00:39:04.260 --> 00:39:05.220
I don't think so.
我想我不知道。

1185
00:39:05.500 --> 00:39:05.760
Okay.
好吧。

1186
00:39:05.840 --> 00:39:07.160
You don't know that we almost died three times?
你不知道我们差点死了三次吗？

1187
00:39:07.160 --> 00:39:08.340
Did something happen?
发生什么事了吗？

1188
00:39:08.920 --> 00:39:10.100
Oh my God.
我的天哪。

1189
00:39:10.100 --> 00:39:10.980
I don't think I know about death.
我想我不知道什么死亡的事。

1190
00:39:11.080 --> 00:39:12.080
This is not hyperbole.
这不是夸张。

1191
00:39:12.460 --> 00:39:14.160
We almost died three times.
我们差点死了三次。

1192
00:39:14.400 --> 00:39:14.620
Yeah.
对。

1193
00:39:14.920 --> 00:39:15.240
Okay.
好吧。

1194
00:39:15.620 --> 00:39:16.460
What happened?
发生什么了？

1195
00:39:16.700 --> 00:39:18.580
First of all, here's the first time.
首先，这是第一次。

1196
00:39:19.540 --> 00:39:20.920
And poor Bryan Cranston.
可怜的布莱恩·科兰斯顿。

1197
00:39:21.120 --> 00:39:23.160
It's his week off from Breaking Bad.
那是他拍《绝命毒师》的调休周。

1198
00:39:23.200 --> 00:39:24.120
And he's like, great.
他当时想，太好了。

1199
00:39:24.180 --> 00:39:26.700
I'm going to be inside air conditioned in an office.
我能在有空调的办公室里待着了。

1200
00:39:26.860 --> 00:39:28.740
No, we're putting you on a bus.
不，我们要把你塞进大巴里。

1201
00:39:28.920 --> 00:39:30.240
It's 110 degrees out.
外面有110华氏度。

1202
00:39:31.080 --> 00:39:33.060
And that's what we filmed in outside.
我们就是在这种天气下在室外拍的。

1203
00:39:33.260 --> 00:39:33.740
It was so hot.
太热了。

1204
00:39:33.760 --> 00:39:33.960
I remember that.
我记得。

1205
00:39:34.180 --> 00:39:34.340
Yeah.
是啊。

1206
00:39:34.700 --> 00:39:36.200
I remember the bus.
我记得那辆大巴。

1207
00:39:36.300 --> 00:39:38.860
Like I was, I don't remember everyone almost dying on the bus.
不过我怎么不记得大家差点死在大巴上呢。

1208
00:39:38.860 --> 00:39:42.800
Okay, so imagine the bus is full of desk lamps.
好吧，想象一下大巴里塞满了台灯。

1209
00:39:43.460 --> 00:39:45.020
Did I get off the bus at some point?
我中途下车了吗？

1210
00:39:45.100 --> 00:39:46.760
Because I remember with Cranston very specifically,
因为我清楚地记得和克兰斯顿在一起时，

1211
00:39:46.760 --> 00:39:51.220
he was trying to get me to do this really big physical gag.
他一直在引诱我做一个非常夸张的形体滑稽动作。

1212
00:39:51.220 --> 00:39:54.220
And I just said, this is like the lamest, most actory thing I'll say.
然后我说了句，这可能是我说过最无聊、最像演员装腔作势的话。

1213
00:39:54.300 --> 00:39:55.560
But I was like, Clark would not do that.
但当时我就觉得，克拉克才不会那样做。

1214
00:39:56.160 --> 00:39:57.540
Like, I don't believe this.
就是，我不信这个。

1215
00:39:57.620 --> 00:39:58.640
Like, I would not do this.
就是，我才不会这么干。

1216
00:39:59.080 --> 00:40:00.580
So I remember being on the bus.
所以我记得在车上。

1217
00:40:00.700 --> 00:40:02.180
I don't remember everyone almost dying.
我不记得大家都差点死掉。

1218
00:40:02.420 --> 00:40:07.280
Well, because you leave, you stay behind and you teach Daryl PowerPoint.
哦，因为你下车了，你留下来教达里尔用PowerPoint。

1219
00:40:07.380 --> 00:40:08.140
Yes, yes, yes.
对，对，对。

1220
00:40:08.140 --> 00:40:09.880
And then Creed get off the bus.
然后克里德下了车。

1221
00:40:09.940 --> 00:40:10.200
Yes, yes.
对，对。

1222
00:40:10.380 --> 00:40:10.820
Okay, okay.
好，好。

1223
00:40:11.340 --> 00:40:13.120
And then after that, you guys almost died?
然后在那之后，你们差点死了？

1224
00:40:13.120 --> 00:40:13.600
No, no, no.
不，不，不。

1225
00:40:13.720 --> 00:40:14.520
Okay, let's set it up.
好吧，我们来还原一下。

1226
00:40:14.580 --> 00:40:15.760
I'm just going to say two things.
我只说两点。

1227
00:40:15.780 --> 00:40:16.920
We're driving down the road.
我们开在路上。

1228
00:40:17.120 --> 00:40:18.740
A stunt driver makes a hard right.
特技司机猛地向右打方向盘。

1229
00:40:19.100 --> 00:40:21.220
We were supposed to pretend like we're being jostled.
我们本该假装被晃得东倒西歪。

1230
00:40:21.420 --> 00:40:22.540
They're like, everybody go to the right.
他们说，大家往右倒。

1231
00:40:22.720 --> 00:40:23.780
Yeah, and it didn't work.
对，但没起作用。

1232
00:40:23.960 --> 00:40:26.120
So they're like, we're going to put the stunt driver in.
所以他们说，我们要让特技司机上。

1233
00:40:26.200 --> 00:40:27.340
He's going to take a hard right.
他要猛打右方向盘。

1234
00:40:27.740 --> 00:40:28.940
He takes a hard right.
他猛打右方向盘。

1235
00:40:29.100 --> 00:40:30.380
Yeah, but you're not stunt passengers.
对，但你们又不是特技演员乘客。

1236
00:40:30.600 --> 00:40:31.880
And nothing's nailed down.
而且什么都没钉牢固定。

1237
00:40:32.040 --> 00:40:33.720
So everything goes flying.
所以所有东西都飞了起来。

1238
00:40:34.220 --> 00:40:34.580
Everything.
全飞了。

1239
00:40:34.780 --> 00:40:35.580
You were in the bus.
你当时也在车上。

1240
00:40:38.140 --> 00:40:42.800
Imagine Creed being covered by a bookshelf and paper, Phyllis on the ground.
想象一下克里德被书架和纸张压在下面，菲利斯倒在地上。

1241
00:40:42.940 --> 00:40:44.040
Me on top of her.
我压在她身上。

1242
00:40:44.180 --> 00:40:44.400
Yeah.
是啊。

1243
00:40:44.520 --> 00:40:45.020
Was that real?
那是真的吗？

1244
00:40:45.140 --> 00:40:46.060
That just happened on accident?
那是发生意外了吗？

1245
00:40:46.280 --> 00:40:47.220
Like that was not planned?
就是说那不是计划好的？

1246
00:40:47.440 --> 00:40:48.160
That was not planned.
那不是计划好的。

1247
00:40:48.260 --> 00:40:48.940
That was not planned.
那真不是计划好的。

1248
00:40:49.260 --> 00:40:49.660
Wow.
哇。

1249
00:40:49.920 --> 00:40:50.940
No, I did not know this.
不，我根本不知道这事。

1250
00:40:51.260 --> 00:40:52.500
So there were some injuries.
所以还是有人受伤了。

1251
00:40:52.700 --> 00:40:52.840
Wow.
哇。

1252
00:40:52.840 --> 00:40:53.300
They had to get off.
他们不得不下车。

1253
00:40:53.420 --> 00:40:54.460
They had to redress the bus.
他们不得不重新布置那辆巴士。

1254
00:40:54.640 --> 00:40:56.140
They had to help people who got injured.
他们不得不去帮助受伤的人。

1255
00:40:57.340 --> 00:40:57.720
Then...
然后……

1256
00:40:57.720 --> 00:40:58.600
I did not know this.
我之前都不知道这件事。

1257
00:40:58.760 --> 00:40:59.540
This is wild.
这也太离谱了。

1258
00:40:59.660 --> 00:41:00.600
This is the big one.
这才是重头戏。

1259
00:41:01.340 --> 00:41:05.280
Then we're on the bus and it's hot and they're trying to figure out how they can cool us off.
然后我们在车上，车里很热，他们在想办法帮我们降温。

1260
00:41:05.420 --> 00:41:08.240
They put a big tube of air coming in.
他们接进来一根粗大的送风管。

1261
00:41:08.340 --> 00:41:08.720
Great.
太好了。

1262
00:41:08.880 --> 00:41:09.840
We're getting cooled off.
我们在降温了。

1263
00:41:09.960 --> 00:41:13.140
They were like dragging an air conditioning unit behind the bus.
他们就像是拖着一台空调在巴士后面。

1264
00:41:13.440 --> 00:41:13.960
They attached it.
他们把它连接上了。

1265
00:41:14.100 --> 00:41:14.240
Yeah.
是啊。

1266
00:41:14.540 --> 00:41:15.660
Had a tube coming in.
有一根管子伸进来。

1267
00:41:15.900 --> 00:41:18.220
Guess where the intake of that machine was.
你猜那台机器的进气口在哪里。

1268
00:41:18.480 --> 00:41:19.100
Can you guess?
你能猜到吗？

1269
00:41:19.260 --> 00:41:20.320
Next to the diesel engine?
在柴油发动机旁边？

1270
00:41:20.320 --> 00:41:20.820
Right over...
就在……

1271
00:41:20.820 --> 00:41:22.540
And the vent was right over Jenna's head.
而且出风口正好在珍娜的头顶上方。

1272
00:41:22.640 --> 00:41:22.800
Yeah.
对。

1273
00:41:22.860 --> 00:41:22.960
Right?
是吧？

1274
00:41:23.260 --> 00:41:24.440
I'm in the front of the bus.
我坐在巴士的前面。

1275
00:41:24.720 --> 00:41:25.840
Jenna's like, I smell something.
珍娜就说，我闻到有什么味道。

1276
00:41:26.000 --> 00:41:26.820
Something smells weird.
有什么味道怪怪的。

1277
00:41:27.240 --> 00:41:28.880
One of the camera people gets lightheaded.
其中一个摄像师开始头晕眼花。

1278
00:41:29.380 --> 00:41:30.200
Jenna's like, I smell something.
珍娜就说，我闻到味儿了。

1279
00:41:30.320 --> 00:41:31.180
And we're like, no, it's nothing.
我们还说，没有啦，没什么。

1280
00:41:31.380 --> 00:41:36.300
And then Bryan Cranston comes in, stands on a chair and Jenna points and he goes, everyone
然后布莱恩·科兰斯顿进来了，站到椅子上，珍娜指着那边，他大喊：所有人

1281
00:41:36.300 --> 00:41:37.620
off the bus right now.
立刻下车！

1282
00:41:38.200 --> 00:41:38.600
Wow.
哇。

1283
00:41:38.600 --> 00:41:40.020
We were getting carbon monoxide.
我们当时在一氧化碳中毒。

1284
00:41:40.380 --> 00:41:40.640
Yeah.
对啊。

1285
00:41:40.780 --> 00:41:42.160
No, that really could have killed everybody.
真的，那可是会要了所有人命的。

1286
00:41:42.380 --> 00:41:42.580
Yeah.
对。

1287
00:41:42.600 --> 00:41:42.780
I know.
我知道。

1288
00:41:50.320 --> 00:41:51.080
That sounds awful.
听起来太可怕了。

1289
00:41:52.120 --> 00:41:52.520
Wow.
哇。

1290
00:41:53.020 --> 00:41:57.020
We thought for sure Jake would have come like to the next day at work and been like, oh
我们还笃定杰克第二天来上班时一定会说，天

1291
00:41:57.020 --> 00:41:57.700
my God.
哪。

1292
00:41:58.180 --> 00:41:59.260
He didn't say anything.
他什么都没说。

1293
00:41:59.460 --> 00:41:59.800
No.
没有。

1294
00:41:59.900 --> 00:42:00.160
No.
没说。

1295
00:42:00.760 --> 00:42:01.160
Wow.
哇。

1296
00:42:01.640 --> 00:42:03.260
Maybe he's just not a big complainer.
也许他只是个不爱抱怨的人吧。

1297
00:42:04.200 --> 00:42:04.600
Okay.
好吧。

1298
00:42:06.920 --> 00:42:09.060
No, I'm glad I was not on this bus though.
不过还好我没在这辆车上。

1299
00:42:09.180 --> 00:42:10.180
And I had no idea.
而我当时完全不知情。

1300
00:42:10.620 --> 00:42:11.640
This is wild.
这太疯狂了。

1301
00:42:11.840 --> 00:42:11.980
Yeah.
是啊。

1302
00:42:12.120 --> 00:42:13.280
We all call it death bus.
我们都叫它死亡巴士。

1303
00:42:13.720 --> 00:42:14.120
Wow.
哇。

1304
00:42:14.300 --> 00:42:14.420
Yeah.
是啊。

1305
00:42:14.920 --> 00:42:15.320
Yeah.
是啊。

1306
00:42:15.660 --> 00:42:18.240
Well, you guys, please go check out Clark's movie.
好了，大家，请去看看克拉克的电影。

1307
00:42:18.420 --> 00:42:19.660
Clark, this is so fun.
克拉克，这太有趣了。

1308
00:42:19.660 --> 00:42:20.220
Thank you.
谢谢你。

1309
00:42:20.380 --> 00:42:21.360
Thank you for coming.
谢谢你们来。

1310
00:42:21.640 --> 00:42:22.040
Of course.
当然。

1311
00:42:22.320 --> 00:42:25.840
Everyone, it's really great and it's unique and it's a story you haven't seen.
各位，这部电影真的很棒，非常独特，而且是一个你从未见过的故事。

1312
00:42:25.860 --> 00:42:26.960
I can promise you that.
我向你们保证。

1313
00:42:27.220 --> 00:42:33.140
And it's visually interesting and funny and it's filled with really, really superb performances.
它视觉效果很有趣，搞笑，并且充满了非常非常精彩的表演。

1314
00:42:33.400 --> 00:42:34.040
Oh, thank you.
哦，谢谢你。

1315
00:42:34.400 --> 00:42:34.880
Thank you.
谢谢。

1316
00:42:34.960 --> 00:42:35.040
Yeah.
是啊。

1317
00:42:35.180 --> 00:42:36.140
That's very important to me.
这对我很重要。

1318
00:42:36.220 --> 00:42:36.860
That's nice to hear.
听到这个很高兴。

1319
00:42:37.020 --> 00:42:38.840
And it's got a great Christmas soundtrack.
而且它有一首很棒的圣诞原声带。

1320
00:42:39.160 --> 00:42:44.960
So all the music in the movie is original Christmas music by Teresa Wayman of the band
电影里所有的音乐都是特蕾莎·韦曼创作的原创圣诞音乐，她是

1321
00:42:44.960 --> 00:42:47.180
Warpaint, who are kind of like indie rock legends.
Warpaint 乐队的成员，他们有点像独立摇滚传奇。

1322
00:42:47.180 --> 00:42:51.140
And then Elle King, who's in the movie, also is singing on Jingle Bell Rock.
然后参演这部电影的埃尔·金也在《铃儿响叮当》中献唱。

1323
00:42:51.680 --> 00:42:52.680
Oh, so cool.
哦，太酷了。

1324
00:42:52.860 --> 00:42:53.060
Yeah.
是啊。

1325
00:42:53.220 --> 00:42:55.760
And the soundtrack will be out, I believe, November 6th.
我想原声带将于 11 月 6 日发行。

1326
00:42:55.820 --> 00:42:56.660
Oh, that's fantastic.
哦，那太棒了。

1327
00:42:57.160 --> 00:43:00.020
So pretty soon for everybody listening, you should be able to find that on Apple and Spotify.
对所有听众来说很快就能在 Apple 和 Spotify 上找到了。

1328
00:43:00.020 --> 00:43:04.060
There'll be the score and the separate, the soundtrack release, which I'm going to do
会有配乐以及单独的原声带发行，我打算做

1329
00:43:04.060 --> 00:43:08.040
like dialogue interstitials, like kind of a like 90s soundtrack where it's got like
那种对话插曲，有点像 90 年代的原声带，里面有

1330
00:43:08.040 --> 00:43:09.520
dialogue clips and then the song.
对话片段，然后是歌曲。

1331
00:43:09.680 --> 00:43:12.000
So it's sort of like you can listen along to the movie type of thing.
所以有点像是你可以边听边回顾电影的那种感觉。

1332
00:43:12.000 --> 00:43:15.220
Send us that and I'll share it when it's out for our listeners.
发给我们吧，等它发行后我会分享给我们的听众。

1333
00:43:15.540 --> 00:43:21.520
And I would love to just wrap up with one last comment, you guys, from the last time
我只想最后做个总结，各位，关于上一次

1334
